      "source": "Declare a <a href=\"Table.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>Table</code></a> to <code>SELECT … FROM</code>. Multiple calls to this or other <code>from</code> methods keep\nadding items to the select list and do not replace previously contained items.",
